<span id="S3.T1.2.4.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S3.T1.2.4.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Hiding Information</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="S3.T1.2.4.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:0.9pt;padding-bottom:0.9pt;">
<span id="S3.T1.2.4.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:184.9pt;">
<span id="S3.T1.2.4.2.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S3.T1.2.4.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">The design obscures or delays details that may influence decision-making until later in the user journey.</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="S3.T1.2.4.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:0.9pt;padding-bottom:0.9pt;">
