<span id="S3.T1.2.4.3.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S3.T1.2.4.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">User uncovers the hidden information and takes action based on a more complete understanding.</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
