<div id="A6.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A6.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Table <a href="#A6.T5" title="Table 5 ‣ Appendix F Questionnaire ‣ Dark Patterns Meet GUI Agents: LLM Agent Susceptibility to Manipulative Interfaces and the Role of Human Oversight" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a> provided the specific questionnaire items used to assess each characteristic and awareness of dark patterns.</p>
</div>
